// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1897013826" "Excellent. Compile all the reports on this 'Ruladak', then execute the captives."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2506809214" "I'll not waste my second gift of life with a loss to you!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P783940918" "Captive shard native"
// Description :
"P3897471301" "captives"
// SingularDescription :
"P3331542464" "One captive left"
// InteractBeginString :
"P856364347" ""
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1118288540" "They asked us again and again about myths and stories, especially about the Legend of Ruladak"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P923447303" "Why did they care so much about the Legend of Ruladak?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4064677838" "We were gathering Kora Fruit for Helen's new baby when they attacked."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3314349675" "Captive soldier"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1176117180" "They butchered the rest of my unit, but kept me for interrogation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2502580806" "You freed the captives and defeated the Nemesis Base Leader, who had some important information on him"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1594113605" "Ruladak? They were doing all of this to learn about an old legend? Ruladak the Strong is a myth told to children to keep them from wandering into trouble. According to the myths, Ruladak was supposed to be the master of the Rularuu, but was imprisoned by kindness after the madness broke the world. It's just a story to get children to behave. Why would the Prince of Brass be interested in that? Still, he holds more people captive, and it shall be necessary to free them."
// RandomFameString :
"P4175274135" "My cousin adopted an orphaned baby form the Shadow Shard. Named the cute little thing Helen, after the little orphan's dead mother."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1030850433" "The machine-hearted devil army of the Nemesis still hold many of my people captive in their bases in your world. With the information you have found and Lieutenant Colonel Flynn's help, I can provide you the location where the captives are kept."
// AcceptString :
"P3701109752" "Rescue captive natives from the Nemesis Army in Paragon City"
// SendOffString :
"P1692230967" "You will need to free the captives from the Nemesis, and Lieutenant Colonel Flynn also asks that you defeat the Nemesis base's leaders to pry information from them. I know you will succeed."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4084380445" "I am counting on you to bring my people back safe and defeat the leaders of the base where they are held. I know you will succeed, for that is what heroes do."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3413367109" "This is the end for you, {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P773049895" "This hidden monitoring station is probably used by the Nemesis Army to detect portal transfers. If so, they know you're coming."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT  
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P316629621" "Captain Bullfred"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2537604419" "So, {TaskForceName} has come to take my command, eh?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P171223617" "Your crushing defeat at my hands shall raise me to the top, {TaskForceName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SingularDescription :
"P329633806" "One captive to rescue"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1625999370" "Thanks, {Rescuer}. I just hope the rest of my unit was okay."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4164060216" "They kept asking us about the Ruladak and the Rularuu."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P558617387" "I'd never seen the true Paragon City before. I can't wait to see it now that I'm free!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4228888679" "All they wanted to know about was the legend of Ruladak and the Rularuu. But I don't know why."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3368431546" "Old Fred, a captive native"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3622777641" "Ruladak, that cursed thing. They knew of the myth, and more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2925332816" "You freed the captives and defeated Captain Bullfred and  his men."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P678730260" "Why would they be so interested in Ruladak? It's an old myth, it's nothing real. Let me tell it to you: <br><br>The Legend of Ruladak is about a monster that controls the Rularuu. We tell it ever since the madness broke the world, to remind us that we have to help each other to survive. <br><br>The legend goes that after the madness broke the world, there was a time when kindness walked the land and all were hopeful. But then Ruladak the Strong appeared. He was angry because the People of Paragon had turned away from the Rularuu, and so he sought to slay the people of Paragon to punish them. Fearing for the people, all the kindness in the world gathered itself together and tried to destroy Ruladak and the Rularuu. The battle lasted for days and broke the very islands, but in the end there was only enough kindness to force Ruladak into a deep slumber. He still guides the Rularuu even in his sleep, but as long as kindness remains strong in the hearts of the People of Paragon, Ruladak will never awaken and we will be spared. <br><br>I know it must sound foolish to great heroes like you, but it's just a story for children. Though, I used to think that the Prince of Brass was just a story, too."
// RandomFameString :
"P3430924790" "I wonder how the Nemesis Army captured those Shadow Shard refugees? Good thing {TaskForceName} was there."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P755899023" "The peoples of Paragon need you ever more, {TaskForceName}! Scouts of my people have spotted a new group of those brass-hearted devils, the Nemesis Army. They no doubt seek to capture and torture more of us. Our scouts followed this new group, and now I ask you to defeat them before they can establish a base for themselves and cause more harm."
// AcceptString :
"P4240728766" "Defeat new Nemesis Army force before they can establish a base"
// SendOffString :
"P3579822342" "You shall have to defeat them all, machine and man alike, lest they bring more of their kind over to attack my people. <br><br>Lieutenant Colonel Flynn also asks again that you search for information. We still don't know why Nemesis, the Prince of Brass, would be interested in a legend like Ruladak. I hate to think it, but the old legends said that the Prince of Brass had schemes within schemes and plans within plans. Maybe he knows something that we do not."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1348280400" "Defeat all Nemesis in base"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3493374788" "You must defeat all of the Nemesis Army gathered there before they can complete a new base to attack my people. <br><br>Lieutenant Colonel Flynn also asks again that you search for information. We still don't know why Nemesis would be interested in a legend like Ruladak."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P4235817958" "The interior of the cavern has been cleaned, and there are survey marks on the ground and walls. Someone has been planning to do some construction here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3161670897" "Captain Easting"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P4103374408" "This plan concerns me. Perhaps I should write a letter of protest?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2577460900" "No time for worries. To battle!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P454989290" "After defeating all of the Nemesis Army forces, you found a half-finished letter."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2899251632" "You have once more shown your courage, but the news you found is troubling. The Nemesis Army speaks of 'awakening' a legend, perhaps of allying with the Rularuu. It is worse than madness, it's certain doom! The Prince of Brass was supposed to be devious, not suicidal! Now, {TaskForceName}, we must find out if this is true, lest the madness comes to break the world again."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3116624030" "I had hoped to find you the source of many of our legends of Ruladak, the wise Old Fred. You saved his life before, I thought he would surely help you. He was being re-settled in Paragon City after his ordeal, but it seems that he returned to the Shard to find something, and has now been captured. His captors were seen, and this is strange. They weren't the Nemesis Army or the Rularuu, but the Green-Eye Cult."
// AcceptString :
"P3584127310" "Rescue Old Fred from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P2361034690" "The Cult of the Green Eye was also in our myths, but only whispers of them. Lieutenant Colonel Flynn calls them the Circle of Thorns, and says that they are mighty wizards. They must indeed be powerful, for even the Rularuu rarely attack them. I do not know what they could want with Old Fred, but you must rescue him to learn more about what the Nemesis may know about the Legend of Ruladak."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2288164159" "Rescue Old Fred"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P391440903" "You must rescue Old Fred from the Circle of Thorns to learn what the Nemesis may have learned about the Legend of Ruladak."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1685624140" "An otherworldly energy flows through these caverns. An energy all too familiar to anyone who's set foot in lost Oranbega."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2717656149" "Death Mage"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P879940067" "You shall find no lore here, only your death."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT  
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT  :
"P2371613295" "We will interrogate your souls in Oranbega!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3702754473" "Bah! This 'Old Fred' is barely 35. How much could he know?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P641829139" "You seek to impede us? You're only helping the Nemesis Army!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P3664808971" "Old Fred"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2529549994" "Ruladak, I curse you still! Why couldn't they let a legend be?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3106624892" "You rescued Old Fred and heard his story."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2850908750" "Ruladak is something real? It's supposed to be a myth. It's all supposed to be a story to make children be nice. That's all. And the Prince of Brass, and the Green-eye Cult, it's all supposed to just be stories. Things we'd leave behind now that we could go to the real Paragon City, the promised land where heroes soar. <br><br>I'm sorry, great heroes, I am being childish. These myths are real, and must be dealt with. That is my duty, as it was my fathers and his before him. There is much work still to be done."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4043224088" "I have spoken with Old Fred, and he has told me that the Cult of the Green Eye have taken his father's book back to their city. He says that he saw the demon who ferried it back, and saw the entrance to the city through the portal it made. I have spoken with Lieutenant Colonel Flynn, and he has helped pin down where this entrance might be. When you are ready, you will need to return to Paragon City, and retrieve the book from the Circle of Thorns."
// AcceptString :
"P828110524" "Return to Paragon City and retrieve the book from the Circle of Thorns"
// SendOffString :
"P3757587435" "The Cult of the Green Eye cannot be allowed to use the book to their own ends. You must not only recover it, you must also defeat all the cultists present to halt their research into it. I know that this feat is within your power, {TaskForceName}. Once we have the book, maybe we can understand what the Legend of Ruladak truly is, and why the Nemesis seek its source."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4060613778" "Defeat all Circle cultists"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P349125053" "The Cult of the Green Eye cannot be allowed to use the book to their own ends. You must not only recover it, you must also defeat all the cultists present to halt their research into it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1223925806" "The shadowed stone halls of Oranbega press in on all sides. You only hope that the book is down here."

