"P2277043494" "You recovered the book and disrupted the Circle's research"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2628359460" "{TaskForceName}, you have fought as champions! With this book recovered, we have gained much knowledge that was lost. There is much in the book you found that is unknown to me. I wish my father had told me more about what happened when the madness broke the world, but like most of our elders he said it was best if we just forgot it all and made our start here. Maybe the book's talk about Oaths to the Rularuu has something to do with their reluctance."
// RandomFameString :
"P4270228190" "The Circle of Thorns were riled up because {TaskForceName} took some book from them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2514684496" "Lieutenant Colonel Flynn has sent the book you recovered to Fire Base Zulu for analysis. There is still much that needs your attention, though. Another group of Kora Fruit gatherers have gone missing, and I fear that the Nemesis Army have struck again. You must rescue them."
// AcceptString :
"P2558320912" "Rescue captured natives"
// SendOffString :
"P551097789" "I have marked for you their last location. You will need to find them and free them from their captors. That will be your only goal."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P563392533" "Free captive natives"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4084142730" "Your only goal now is to free the captives held by the enemies of the People of Paragon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1124600575" "You realize instantly that something is wrong here. There are no signs of the Nemesis Army, but there might be another group of enemies here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3679422693" "Captive native"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3049618170" "They interrogated us for hours before you came. The wisps. So cruel."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2812312960" "They wanted to know about the Prince of Brass and his devil army. They took all they could from us."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P1232904259" "They said they spoke for Ruladak. They said that they interrogated us for him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1551329061" "You rescued the captured Shard Natives from the Rularuu."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P739015527" "Why would the Rularuu want to know about the Prince of Brass? If they were truly gathering information on the Brasswork Devils of the Nemesis Army, then what does that mean?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1454202816" "Brave scouts of the People of Paragon have found a new base controlled by the Nemesis Army. This is more dire than it first appears, because the base is playing host to members of the Rularuu. We do not think they are there as prisoners, but as guests. If the Prince of Brass or his men are making plans alongside the hated Rularuu, they must be stopped!"
// AcceptString :
"P2415123179" "Attack Nemesis base and prevent an alliance between the Nemesis Army and the Rularuu."
// SendOffString :
"P2762290277" "We know that the Nemesis are seeking out the truth behind the Legend of Ruladak, and now the Rularuu are responding. This has to be stopped before they unleash a horror upon us all. It is too much to risk any alliance. You must defeat them all, and seek for any information that may help us."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1075024899" "Defeat all foes in base"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1349577615" "The outer gates of this new Nemesis compound lie open behind you. Inside you can hear the sounds of orderly Nemesis Army troops and the alien noises of the Rularuu."

