"P2824644714" "You defeated the base, and found the location of a Nemesis Portal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2919129512" "Free Ruladak? It is madness! It will be like when the madness broke the world come again! This must be stopped. I must speak with Lieutenant Colonel Flynn. This must be stopped. There must be a way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission9 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1232287759" "I have spoken with many others, and thanks to the book written by Old Fred's father that you recovered, there may still be a chance to stop the Nemesis Army from freeing Ruladak the strong. There is little time, though, and if there is to be a chance, then you shall have to strike hard and fast, {TaskForceName}. Ready yourselves. The first task shall be to stop the first seal from being broken."
// AcceptString :
"P2320211587" "Prevent the first seal from being broken."
// SendOffString :
"P2053265368" "According to the treaty you captured and the details of Old Fred's father's book, there are four seals that hold Ruladak the Strong from his freedom. The Nemesis Army will attempt to break all of them to fulfill their deal. The first seal has been located in caverns on the One-Way path. Defeat all who oppose you, and prevent the seal from being broken."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2831514303" "Defeat all foes in caverns"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1031118396" "We must prevent the release of Ruladak the Strong. You must defeat all who threaten the first Seal, and make sure that it is safe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2321333412" "There is a strange, yet calming power in this place. Even as you ready yourselves for battle, you feel a sense of peace flow over you all."

