// Dialog :
"P3549543398" "You were too late, and the first Seal had already been destroyed by the Nemesis Army."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P432304176" "Those Brass-hearted Devils have not won yet, {TaskForceName}. We must not despair. There are still 3 more seals they must break to awaken Ruladak the Strong."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission10 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2952902559" "The first seal is already broken, but there may be time yet to stop Ruladak's full awakening. Dr. Boyd of the expedition has found out from his study that the seals can be used as well as protected or broken. The next target of the Nemesis is a seal on Ruladak's power. But if we can use it first, we can limit Ruladak to less than his full power should he awaken. Gather yourselves and be ready, there is little time."
// AcceptString :
"P3554768436" "Use the second seal to weaken Ruladak"
// SendOffString :
"P4201552853" "You must locate the seal and prevent the Nemesis Army from breaking it. It should be in a cavern around the Crimson Falls. You must also secure it by defeating all foes so that it may be used as a weapon against Ruladak."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1537893270" "The strange calming feeling returns to you the moment you enter these caverns."

