// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1367416333" "The Second Seal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3101760176" "The second seal is intact."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1774959030" "You were able to save the second seal from the Nemesis Army"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3942421485" "I am told that mystics from Paragon City are already working magic upon the seal. You have all done us a great service, {TaskForceName}. I hope he will never be wakened, but should it come to be, Ruladak will be greatly weakened. We must hope that will be enough."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission11 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2399763786" "One seal is broken and one is being used against Ruladak, but there are two more seals that remain. The next seal is the weakest of the four, but Dr. Boyd says it is so because it's using its power in another way. It is warned in the book that the third seal prevents Ruladak from rejoining with the full power of Rularuu. I do not know what that means, but I think it best if we kept that rejoining from happening."
// AcceptString :
"P2777166313" "Secure the third of Ruladak's seals"
// SendOffString :
"P2363301228" "Dr. Boyd has said that this seal is already preventing a stronger connection between Ruladak and the Rularuu in his slumbers. If we can turn it against Ruladak, it will keep the link closed, even if he awakens. The Seal is located in a cave on the Chanting Islands. You will need to secure it and defeat all of the enemies who would break it. I know you will succeed, great heroes."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P884722070" "Secure 3rd seal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P132202311" "You must defeat all the foes within the caverns and locate the third seal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1510367123" "You experience a strange sensation the moment you enter these caverns. Then you suddenly realize that this is the first time you haven't felt like you were being watched since you entered the Shadow Shard."

