// Dialog :
"P3568734571" "You were able to save the third seal from the Nemesis Army"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3785219594" "More mystics have arrived to do their work upon the third seal. As I am told, the power of the seal is already working, but may need to be re-enforced if Ruladak is awakened. There is now one seal remaining, but many are worried still. Even two seals may be enough to awaken Ruladak the Strong. Then our old legends will have a new fear at their heart."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission12 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3030231528" "There is one last seal to secure, and it may be the most important. It is the one which can restore wakefulness to Ruladak. Thanks to your work he would be weakened, and he would be without the full power of the Rularuu, but we do not know how powerful he would be. The Nemesis charge ahead blind to all but their own ambition. It is up to you to stop them."
// AcceptString :
"P2505186655" "Secure the 4th of Ruladak's seals"
// SendOffString :
"P3203410735" "Again, you must defeat all those who would damage or take the seal, and secure it's safety."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1360381868" "Secure 4th seal"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3306731389" "You must defeat all those who would damage or take the seal, and secure it's safety. This is the final seal. If we are lucky, it will end here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2955865068" "The strange calming you've felt in other caverns that had seals is strangely absent here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
