"P843411474" "The fourth seal has been taken!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4016459612" "You were too late, and discovered that the Fourth and final seal had been taken by the Nemesis Army!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P246842170" "The fourth and final seal is gone, but not destroyed. Why? The Nemesis clearly have it. It must be found, and soon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_KillTask13 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P462391688" "The Nemesis have the 4th seal of Ruladak, and it must be found. Perhaps the Nemesis themselves may have a clue to its location. Battle them and seek information. My own scouts and those of Lieutenant Commander Flynn shall do the same."
// AcceptString :
"P423373978" "Battle Nemesis Troops around the Cascades for information"
// SendOffString :
"P956151427" "It is likely that the troops around the Cascades may know. You must battle them wherever they may be in this area to pry information from them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1874602878" "Soon we'll be General Fort's Army!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3514541998" "After one battle, one of the defeated Nemesis Troops told you some information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1271998816" "With this, we may be able to end the Legend of Ruladak before it has a chance to begin again. I will speak to Lieutenant Colonel Flynn, and we shall coordinate our scouts. We will find this base and tell you when we have."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission14 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1289391253" "My scouts have found the Nemesis base where the seal is being held. With the location of General Fort and the final seal, we may be able to end this. I send you now to battle, {TaskForceName}, as my grandfather did in ancient times. You must defeat General Fort and his men, and recover the final seal to save us all from the Legend of Ruladak."
// AcceptString :
"P3518771413" "Defeat General Fort and recover the last of Ruladak's seals."
// SendOffString :
"P612404624" "You must defeat General Fort to end his threat, but you must also recover the fourth and final seal. With luck, it shall be enough and Ruladak shall never awaken."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P94896002" "Defeat General Fort & his staff"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1356570104" "There is a definite feeling of resignation and determination in this base. As if the Nemesis Army under General Fort has only now realized the enormity of their actions."

