"P1844399599" "Perhaps I was a fool, but I lived the way I wanted to. For that, I am unashamed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Seal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3014771134" "You have recoverd the Fourth and Final Seal"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1893166903" "You have defeated General Fort and recovered the seal, but his last words weigh heavily on your thoughts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1942961168" "If General Fort is to be believed, then he was used by Ruladak, and the Strong One is already close to freedom! There is only one option left, {TaskForceName}. If the Legend of Ruladak is about to come true again, then that Legend must be met head-on, and defeated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL8_TFM_Mission15 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P725606951" "Ruladak is awakened, but he is weakened thanks to your valiant efforts. He will soon be able to marshal his creatures and gather his full power. Now is the only time to strike, before he has regained his strength. You must defeat Ruladak the strong."
// AcceptString :
"P2748365177" "Defeat Ruladak the Strong"
// SendOffString :
"P3328944752" "The only task left is to battle Ruladak the Strong before he escapes his bonds within Tyrant's Rock. It is up to you, now. You have fought so hard and so valiantly, Heroes. No matter what, I have been proud to have worked with you, and to have renewed the compact between the People of Paragon and the Heroes of Paragon once more, as my Grandfather did in ancient times. Thank you, Heroes. Thank you."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2494518759" "The only task left is to battle Ruladak the Strong before he escapes his bonds within Tyrant's Rock. It is up to you, now. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1494400612" "An overwhelming evil power stirs the very air with wakening malice."

