// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1479964438" "Though I am weakened, I have might enough still to make Faathim and Lanaru pay for their treachery and their treason!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3063652983" "I have watched you through the Rularuu, {TaskForceName}. Let us battle now, without honor or mercy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - RuladakTStrong 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P625751726" "Defeat Ruladak The Strong"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1325571396" "You feel the entirety of the Shadow Shard shake with the destruction of Ruladak the Strong."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2658744343" "You have defeated Ruladak the Strong, and laid to rest The Legend of Ruladak"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2127465088" "You did it! I know you'd do it, but, you did it! Today there will be a new chapter to the Legend of Ruladak, and it shall tell of the monster's defeat! It's like the legends said! All of the legends about the great Heroes, you made them all come true. I am so glad I was here to see it, to see you win. I thank you, great Heroes. You have done us all so much, so many honors with your valiant deeds. You have defended the Peoples of Paragon as the legendary heroes of old, and have earned your place amongst them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1471589930" "I've heard rumors that {TaskForceName} defeated an ancient monster in the Shadow Shard!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// RandomFameString :
"P2785072879" "I heard {TaskForceName} fought some kind of legendary monster in the Shadow Shard."
